sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Client
    participant S as Search API
    participant R as Redis
    participant A as Aggregator
    participant V as Vendor adapters
    U->>S: search BKK to SIN, 12 Nov, 2 pax, economy
    S->>R: GET merged:v3:BKK:SIN:2026-11-12:2:Y
    R-->>S: miss
    S->>R: SET NX lock:merged:... PX 3000
    alt lock acquired
        S->>A: aggregate(tuple, deadline 1500 ms)
        par fan out
            A->>V: adapter A search
            A->>V: adapter B search
            A->>V: adapter C search
        end
        V-->>A: A and B returned, C timed out
        A->>A: normalise totals, dedupe by flight key, cheapest wins, keep fallbacks
        A-->>S: offers, partial = true, missing = [C]
        S->>R: SET merged key with TTL from volatility plus jitter, DEL lock
    else lock held by another request
        S->>R: wait briefly then GET merged key, or serve stale copy if present
    end
    S-->>U: page 1 with next_cursor, partial flag, price_valid_until per offer
